    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "1EEACFED15ABF95A",
      "text": "欢迎来到圆模道馆！\\n需要再听一次\\r\\n道馆测验的说明吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "1EEACEED15ABF7A7",
      "text": "圆模道馆的道馆测验是……\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]滚橄榄[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "1EEACDED15ABF5F4",
      "text": "只要滚动模仿橄榄制成的球，\\n并把它送到终点，就能通过道馆测验。\\r\\n来年能采到很多橄榄的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "1EEACCED15ABF441",
      "text": "滚橄榄会场\\n在[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]镇子的北边[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！\\c\\n详细规则请去问\\n会场内的工作人员吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "5BE83F2D0544DB8E",
      "text": "欢迎来到滚橄榄会场！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "5BE83E2D0544D9DB",
      "text": "滚橄榄这个道馆测验是\\n通过用全身去撞橄榄巨球，\\r\\n并让它滚起来的体力对决！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "5BE83D2D0544D828",
      "text": "如果能穿过多个障碍物，\\n并把橄榄巨球滚到终点的筐子里，\\r\\n就能通过测验！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "5BE8442D0544E40D",
      "text": "那么，你要挑战滚橄榄\\n这个道馆测验吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "5BE8432D0544E25A",
      "text": "知道了！为了能获得大丰收，\\n请你用力滚橄榄吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "5BE8422D0544E0A7",
      "text": "请在准备好之后\\n告诉我一声吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "5BE8412D0544DEF4",
      "text": "欢迎你！要挑战滚橄榄\\n这个道馆测验吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "5BE8382D0544CFA9",
      "text": "如果你能打赢我，\\n我就让你走近路！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "5BE8372D0544CDF6",
      "text": "迷你芙这一关！\\n看你能不能闯过了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "5BE4BA2D0541C3B8",
      "text": "迷你芙们～！\\n把路让开～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_11",
      "hash64": "5BE4BB2D0541C56B",
      "text": "骑着坐骑宝可梦去推的话，\\n橄榄能滚得更远哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_12",
      "hash64": "5BE4BC2D0541C71E",
      "text": "托[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你的福，\\n来年一定也会大丰收的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_13",
      "hash64": "5BE4BD2D0541C8D1",
      "text": "恭喜！\\n你通过了道馆测验！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_14",
      "hash64": "5BE4BE2D0541CA84",
      "text": "请到前台\\n报告道馆测验的结果吧！\\r\\n和道馆馆主的对战也要加油啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_15",
      "hash64": "5BE4BF2D0541CC37",
      "text": "要放弃滚橄榄吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mushi_020_trainer_16",
      "hash64": "5BE4C02D0541CDEA",
      "text": "真的要放弃吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
